Z||000014||Old Lar||05-14-2001||10:27 PM||||The Carlisle show is Import/KitCar show.  A Fiero is a donor car for may of the KitCars.  MAFOA tagged a Fiero Show onto the Import/KitCar show.  A link of sorts, the stock version of the Kit Car doner.<P>Registration is at Gate 3 at the fairgrounds. There is a registration building outside the gate.  Once registered, or preregistered you will get a sticker for your windshield and that lets you into the fairgrounds proper.<P>MAFOA will be to the right, just before the vendor area.||||reg||3
